sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Consumer as SDK Consumer
    participant Session as HESession
    participant Config as CKKSConfig
    participant Model as Encrypted Value + Metadata
    participant Contract as Operation Contract
    participant Adapter as Selected Backend Adapter
    participant Native as Native HE Runtime

    Consumer->>Session: encrypt(values)
    Session->>Config: validate_values(values)
    Config-->>Session: normalized finite values within range/batch size
    Session->>Adapter: encrypt(values)
    Adapter->>Native: encode and encrypt with session public key
    Native-->>Adapter: ciphertext handle
    Session->>Model: create EncryptedVector(level=0, valid_count, shape)
    Model-->>Consumer: EncryptedVector

    Consumer->>Session: calculation(encrypted input)
    Session->>Contract: read operation requirements
    Session->>Model: validate session ownership and metadata

    alt add or subtract
        Note over Contract,Native: Two compatible vectors · depth cost 0<br/>No multiplication or rotation key
        Session->>Adapter: add(left,right) or subtract(left,right)
        Adapter->>Native: EvalAdd or EvalSub
        Native-->>Session: vector ciphertext
        Session->>Model: preserve level, clear checksum
    else multiply
        Note over Contract,Native: Two compatible vectors · depth cost 1<br/>Uses multiplication/relinearization keys
        Session->>Session: require available multiplicative depth
        Session->>Adapter: multiply(left, right)
        Adapter->>Native: EvalMult
        Native-->>Session: vector ciphertext
        Session->>Model: level + 1, clear checksum
    else square
        Note over Contract,Native: One vector · depth cost 1<br/>Uses multiplication/relinearization keys
        Session->>Session: require available multiplicative depth
        Session->>Adapter: square(value)
        Adapter->>Native: EvalSquare
        Native-->>Session: vector ciphertext
        Session->>Model: level + 1, clear checksum
    else sum
        Note over Contract,Native: One vector · depth cost 0<br/>Uses rotation keys and valid_count
        Session->>Adapter: sum(value, valid_count)
        Adapter->>Native: rotate + add valid slots
        Native-->>Session: scalar ciphertext
        Session->>Model: shape=scalar, result_operation=sum
    else mean
        Note over Contract,Native: One vector · depth cost 1<br/>Rotation sum × public scalar 1/n
        Session->>Session: require available multiplicative depth
        Session->>Adapter: mean(value, valid_count)
        Adapter->>Native: rotate + add, then multiply by 1/n
        Native-->>Session: scalar ciphertext
        Session->>Model: level + 1, result_operation=mean
    else variance
        Note over Contract,Native: One vector · depth cost 2<br/>Uses multiplication and rotation keys
        Session->>Session: require available multiplicative depth
        Session->>Adapter: variance(value, valid_count)
        Adapter->>Native: E[x²] - E[x]²
        Native-->>Session: scalar ciphertext
        Session->>Model: level + 2, result_operation=variance
    end

    Model-->>Consumer: EncryptedVector or EncryptedScalar

    opt Trusted session decrypts the result
        Consumer->>Session: decrypt(encrypted result)
        Session->>Session: require open session and secret key
        Session->>Model: validate result belongs to session
        Session->>Adapter: decrypt(handle, valid length)
        Adapter->>Native: decrypt and decode
        Native-->>Consumer: number[] or number
    end

    Note over Session,Native: Calculation APIs never return plaintext.<br/>Only explicit decrypt() uses the session secret key.
